[9:21p.m.] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate 

Traffic in and out of Apongbon is good.
Descending the CMS Bridge to Apongbon is also good.

Ascending the Eko Bridge through Offin Canal and the Market to Costain is all good.

Our Men are strategically located to ensure traffic is unhindered.

